OL,3,GNEWSACharity visited by Catherine set
OL,4,Ato lose council funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity visited by Catherine,
OL,7,FPrincess of Wales says it is fighting
OL,8,Ffor its future after learning that
OL,9,Fcouncil funding is coming to an end.
OL,11,FVsi Razom Community Hub, based in
OL,12,FPrincess Square in Bracknell, was
OL,13,Ffounded in response to the war in
OL,14,FUkraine and supports Ukrainian families
OL,15,Fand the wider community.
OL,17,FThe charity came to national attention
OL,18,Fin October 2023 when Catherine visited
OL,19,Fthe hub and met volunteers.
